  "description": "This collection contains Phase 3 Kentucky From Above 4-band 3\" orthoimagery collected between 2022 - 2024.\n\nAll acquisitions occurred during the Spring, leaf-off season during minimal shadow conditions and when the sun angle was greater than 30° above the horizon.  Other requirements included conditions free from clouds and shadows, smoke, haze, light streaks, snow, ice on water bodies, foliage, flooding, and excessive soil moisture.\n\nFor further information on technical specifications, refer to the KyFromAbove [Technical Specifications Documentation](https://kygeonet.ky.gov/kyfromabove/pdfs/Specs_OrthoPhoto_Production.pdf)",
